{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24363","headline":"闲游即事 · 白居易","name":"闲游即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郊野游行熟，村园次第过。\n蓦山寻浥涧，蹋水渡伊河。\n寒食青青草，春风瑟瑟波。\n逢人共杯酒，随马有笙歌。\n胜事经非少，芳辰过亦多。\n还须自知分，不老拟如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}